    "description": {
      "value": "A wreath of flames dances around the rim of this golden crown. You gain resistance 5 to fire. You absorb some of the flame that would harm you. Increase your fire resistance from the crown from 5 to 15. Just after taking any remaining fire damage, you regain a number of Hit Points equal to 15 or the fire damage dealt by the triggering attack before damage resistance, whichever is less. The constant fire resistance is 15. When activated, the fire resistance and maximum number of Hit Points regained are each 35."
